Z||000000||pHoOl||07-07-2001||12:38 AM||||Question for people who have had time to go looking under their dash.....  How much room is under the passenger side dash?  I looked and it seemed like a bit, but does anyone have any ideas with dimensions?<P>I don't have the sub, so that helps out a lot.  <P>Just to give you an idea of what i'm workin on... I'm building an mp3 player that will read from a CD with burned mp3z and play them through the car stereo.  Yes, i'm well aware of the fact that you can buy an mp3 cd deck for 300 bucks, but i'm a poor college student, needed a summer project and a free 486 came around my way.  And yes 486's can play mp3z.  <P>------------------<BR>Rice mobiles are like tampons... Every p@#%y has one.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>       <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/phoolsig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrgone||07-07-2001||01:27 AM||||do you really think you could stuff a 486 up the subwoofer console?<P>you could prolly build some sort of rack... <BR>then slap one of those cassettes that plug into a portable mp3 player in the sound card.... but then youd need a monitor and a mouse.... ah heck take out the passenger seat and bolt in a computer desk<P>a 586 laptop would be easier<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature_9.jpg">   <BR><B>86.5 2m4 5speed turd 241,000kms</B>||||reg||1
